1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
🎬 Guilda bitaxeBrasil — O guia de Bitaxe mais completo em português

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:14,000
⛏️ O que é Bitaxe?
Um minerador ASIC open-source do tamanho de uma xícara

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:22,000
🔌 Conecta no Wi-Fi e minera Bitcoin na tomada
Sem PC ligado 24h!

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
📦 Chips reciclados de Antminers
+ controlador ESP32-S3

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
⚡ Conheça os 6 modelos

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:42,000
🔄 Max — BM1397
~400 GH/s · ~15W

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,000
🔄 Ultra — BM1366
~400-500 GH/s · ~12W

8
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:58,000
⭐ Supra — BM1368
~625-775 GH/s · ~17 J/TH

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:06,000
🔥 Gamma — BM1370
1.0-1.2 TH/s · ~15 J/TH ⭐ melhor custo-benefício

10
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:14,000
🚀 GT Turbo — 2x BM1370
~2.0-2.15 TH/s

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:22,000
🐋 Hex — 6x BM1366
~3.0-3.3 TH/s

12
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
🎯 Qual escolher?
Gamma = melhor eficiência por watt

13
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
🛠️ Firmware — 3 métodos de atualização

14
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:44,000
📶 1. OTA pela Web
Settings → Update Firmware (preserva tudo)

15
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:52,000
🔌 2. Web Flasher USB
bitaxe.org/flash · Chrome ou Edge

16
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:00,000
⌨️ 3. bitaxetool (CLI)
pip install bitaxetool==0.6.1

17
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,000
🔥 Overclock seguro

18
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:10,000
🔓 Destrave as opções:
/settings?oc

19
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:20,000
🌡️ Limites térmicos
45-55°C ok · 65°C atenção · 75°C+ PERIGO

20
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
⚡ Regras de ouro da voltagem
Máx. 1250 mV 24/7 · nunca acima de 1300 mV

21
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:38,000
📈 Gamma: 600 MHz / 1150 mV
→ ~1.3 TH/s seguro

22
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:42,000
🏊 Pools de mineração

23
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:52,000
🎰 CKPool SOLO — a loteria do Bitcoin
Bloco encontrado = 3.125 BTC

24
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:00,000
🔐 OCEAN — descentralizado
Suporta Stratum V2

25
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:08,000
🏊 ViaBTC e F2Pool
Pools tradicionais

26
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:16,000
💰 Rentabilidade
Pool = centavos/mês · Solo = 3.125 BTC

27
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:24,000
⚡ Custo de energia
~R$ 10 por mês

28
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:32,000
📡 API do AxeOS
/api/system/info · telemetria ao vivo

29
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:40,000
🚨 Dicas rápidas
Fonte fraca = reboots · Calor = troque a pasta térmica

30
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:48,000
❓ Não precisa de PC ligado
Minera só SHA-256 (BTC · BCH · BSV)

31
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:54,000
🌐 bitaxe.org
Guilda bitaxeBrasil no GitHub

